# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# This sub-app builds with npm. The repo root is a pnpm project and ignores
# package-lock.json globally; re-include ours so Netlify detects npm for the
# carbon-app base directory instead of falling back to the root pnpm-lock.yaml
# (whose strict node_modules can't resolve Carbon's Sass imports).
!package-lock.json

